# Twists and Turns: the transform trigger is "when a land YOU control enters" (CR 603.2), so neither casting it with seven lands already out (turn 5) nor an opponent's land
# entering (Bot2's Island on turn 6) transforms it. Bot1's next land, an eighth, on turn 7 does (CR 603.4, 701.27a): the enters trigger sees seven or more lands.

